sequenceDiagram
  participant Browser
  participant Frontend
  participant API
  participant Stripe
  participant DB
  Browser->>Frontend: Click "Subscribe"
  Frontend->>API: POST /api/v1/stripe/checkout (auth)
  API->>Stripe: create Checkout Session (plan.stripe_price_id, customer)
  Stripe-->>API: { sessionId, url }
  API-->>Frontend: { sessionId, url }
  Frontend->>Browser: redirect to Stripe (url)
  Browser->>Stripe: Complete checkout
  Stripe-->>API: webhook POST /api/v1/stripe/webhook (signed)
  API->>API: verify signature (webhook secret)
  API->>DB: find/create stripe_event (idempotency)
  API->>DB: plansRepo.getByStripePriceId -> subscriptionsRepo.upsert
  API-->>Stripe: 200 OK (received:true)
